title: "Pneumonia Detection with Vision Transformers: Paired Statistical Comparison"
abstract: "A Vision Transformer pipeline for paediatric chest X-ray pneumonia classification, with paired statistical significance testing (exact McNemar, DeLong AUC, paired bootstrap, Wilson intervals and Holm-Bonferroni correction)."
